WEBVTT

NOTE Module: REST APIs

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.459
Module 7 teaches professional REST API design. Learn clean resource modeling, idempotency semantics, standard error formatting, and API security headers.

2
00:00:11.459 --> 00:00:23.627
By implementing RFC 7807 problem details, your API provides standardized error objects with status, title, details, and machine-readable error types.

3
00:00:23.627 --> 00:00:36.621
Never return HTTP 200 for error responses. Doing so blinds monitoring tools, CDNs, and API gateways. Always return proper 4xx and 5xx status codes.

4
00:00:36.621 --> 00:00:44.226
Build and test production REST endpoints with schema validation and error handling to generate verified Skill Passport evidence.
